- Within compensation, the increase was led by private wages and salaries based on U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics (BLS) Current Employment Statistics (CES).
- Within government social benefits, the leading contributors to the increase were Medicare and social security benefits, based on data from the Monthly Treasury Statement and the Budget of the U.S. Government.
